                    Howison. Prime Minister Suhrawardy was in
                    Washington for a 3-day official visit, July 10–12.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d221-f2" n="2" xml:id="d221-f2-content">
                <p>Syed Amjad Ali.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
